{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2023-03-08 10:00:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP FURTHER ENHANCES INDUSTRY-LEADING MONEYGUARD® SUITE', 'text': 'RADNOR, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP (NYSE: LNC) CONTINUES TO STRENGTHEN ITS MONEYGUARD® SUITE WITH THE INTRODUCTION OF REAL-TIME UNDERWRITING CAPABILITIES AND THE EXPANSION OF LINCOLN MONEYGUARD MARKET ADVANTAGE® INTO CALIFORNIA. LINCOLN MONEYGUARD MARKET ADVANTAGE® IS A VARIABLE UNIVERSAL LIFE POLICY WITH RIDERS THAT REIMBURSE FOR LONG-TERM CARE EXPENSES; ISSUED BY THE LINCOLN NATIONAL LIFE INSURANCE COMPANY, FORT WAYNE, IN.'}